{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالَ", "translation": "And said"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعُوا۟", "translation": "followed"}, {"text": "لَوْ", "translation": "(Only) if"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "[that]"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "كَرَّةًۭ", "translation": "a return"}, {"text": "فَنَتَبَرَّأَ", "translation": "then we will disown"}, {"text": "مِنْهُمْ", "translation": "[from] them"}, {"text": "كَمَا", "translation": "as"}, {"text": "تَبَرَّءُوا۟", "translation": "they disown"}, {"text": "مِنَّا ۗ", "translation": "[from] us"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "Thus"}, {"text": "يُرِيهِمُ", "translation": "will show them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ", "translation": "their deeds"}, {"text": "حَسَرَٰتٍ", "translation": "(as) regrets"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ ۖ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "هُم", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "بِخَـٰرِجِينَ", "translation": "will come out"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ", "translation": "the Fire"}], "sahih": "Those who followed will say, \"If only we had another turn [at worldly life] so we could disassociate ourselves from them as they have disassociated themselves from us.\" Thus will Allāh show them their deeds as regrets upon them. And they are never to emerge from the Fire."}